variable C31 equal 0.5*(160.263911058717+162.388116381947)
variable C4${dir} equal 0.5*(${C4neg}+${C4pos})
variable C41 equal 0.5*(${C4neg}+${C4pos})
variable C41 equal 0.5*(-0.409447837799348+${C4pos})
