  restoring atom style atomic from restart
  triclinic box = (0.16939548 0.17628645 0.17205965) to (35.800605 35.793714 35.797940) with tilt (0.0000000 0.0000000 0.0000000)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
